	"nodes": [
		{
			"id": "header",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "## Autism\n\nCondition hub: autism heterogeneity, partial cognitive and biological accounts, multi-source assessment, and support framed by autistic perspectives.\n\n[[Autism Map|Open the domain map]] - snapshot of 2026-09-25; the map's *In this folder* section is the live view.",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 0,
			"width": 1680,
			"height": 170,
			"color": "#D9467F"
		},
		{
			"id": "g0",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "Description",
			"x": 0,
			"y": 310,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 1266
		},
		{
			"id": "s0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Autism - Description|Description index]]**",
			"x": 30,
			"y": 360,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 88,
			"color": "#B8A4FF"
		},
		{
			"id": "t0_0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Autism heterogeneity and support needs]]**\n*condition* - 6 sources\n\nHeterogeneity in autism and its consequences: individualised support, frequent co-occurrence, and outcomes beyond measured traits.",
			"x": 30,
			"y": 508,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 242,
			"color": "#D9467F"
		},
		{
			"id": "t0_1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Double empathy]]**\n*theory* - 5 sources\n\nThe proposal that misunderstanding between autistic and non-autistic people is bidirectional, and the evidence that supports it.",
			"x": 30,
			"y": 810,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 218,
			"color": "#D9467F"
		},
		{
			"id": "t0_2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Masking and camouflaging]]**\n*process* - 5 sources\n\nDeliberate and automatic self-presentation strategies, their reported costs, and their consequences for assessment.",
			"x": 30,
			"y": 1088,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 194,
			"color": "#D9467F"
		},
		{
			"id": "t0_3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Social cognition accounts]]**\n*theory* - 6 sources\n\nAccounts that explain autistic social differences through social-cognitive processes, and the criticisms they attracted.",
			"x": 30,
			"y": 1342,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 194,
			"color": "#D9467F"
		},
		{
			"id": "g1",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "Biology",
			"x": 420,
			"y": 310,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 456
		},
		{
			"id": "s1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Autism - Biology|Biology index]]**",
			"x": 450,
			"y": 360,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 88,
			"color": "#B8A4FF"
		},
		{
			"id": "t1_0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Autism genetics and rare variants]]**\n*framework* - 7 sources\n\nCommon and rare variant architecture in autism, what exome sequencing has shown, and why a risk variant is not a diagnosis or a mechanism.",
			"x": 450,
			"y": 508,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 218,
			"color": "#D9467F"
		},
		{
			"id": "g2",
			"type": "group",
			"label": "Assessment and support",
			"x": 840,
			"y": 310,
			"width": 420,
			"height": 1314
		},
		{
			"id": "s2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Autism - Assessment and support|Assessment and support index]]**",
			"x": 870,
			"y": 360,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 88,
			"color": "#B8A4FF"
		},
		{
			"id": "t2_0",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Adult autism assessment and differential considerations]]**\n*method* - 3 sources\n\nRecognition, screening limits, comprehensive multi-source assessment and differential scope in adult autism assessment.",
			"x": 870,
			"y": 508,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 218,
			"color": "#D9467F"
		},
		{
			"id": "t2_1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Autism support and services]]**\n*framework* - 5 sources\n\nHow autism support and services are organised, where medication belongs, and why access and participation are part of the evidence.",
			"x": 870,
			"y": 786,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 218,
			"color": "#D9467F"
		},
		{
			"id": "t2_2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Autistic sensory and communication access]]**\n*framework* - 4 sources\n\nAccess as environmental and communicative design, the cost of camouflaging, and the qualitative evidence base behind these recommendations.",
			"x": 870,
			"y": 1064,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 242,
			"color": "#D9467F"
		},
		{
			"id": "t2_3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Intervention outcomes and autistic perspectives]]**\n*framework* - 6 sources\n\nWhat intervention research measures, what autistic adults say about outcomes, and how the two relate.",
			"x": 870,
			"y": 1366,
			"width": 360,
			"height": 218,
			"color": "#D9467F"
		},
